      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW OLIVE (8) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at this track over 450m behind Power Affect (26.31) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. DARE DEVIL (3) failed to come into contention last start after drifting back at this track, but prior to that won by 2 lengths at Bendigo (28.57) beating White Shiraz in a Grade 5 on September 16. Expected to run well. BEAR IT IS (2) produced a moderate run last time when fifth at this track over 390m behind Kraken Bluey (22.86) in a Grade 5. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Should be about the money. LIKE A BLAZE (6) cannot be ruled out.",
